\v 13 \w And the name| strong="H8034" \w* \w of the second| strong="H8145" \w* \w river| strong="H5104" \w* is \w Gihon| strong="H1521" \w*: the same is [it that compasseth]{strong=“H5437” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the whole land| strong="H776" \w* \w of Ethiopia| strong="H3568" \w*.\f + \fr 2:13 \ft Ethiopia: Heb. Cush \f* 
