\p
\v 16 And the \sc Lord\sc* \w God| strong="H430" \w* [commanded]{strong=“H6680” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w the man| strong="H120" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, \w Of every tree| strong="H6086" \w* \w of the garden| strong="H1588" \w* [thou mayest freely]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} [eat]{strong=“H398” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}:\f + \fr 2:16 \ft thou…: Heb. eating thou shalt eat \f* 
