\v 24 \w Therefore| strong="H3651" \w* \w shall a man| strong="H376" \w* [leave]{strong=“H5800” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his father| strong="H1" \w* \w and his mother| strong="H517" \w*, [and shall cleave]{strong=“H1692” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w unto his wife| strong="H802" \w*: \w and they shall be one| strong="H259" \w* \w flesh| strong="H1320" \w*. 
