\c 11
\p 
\v 1 \w And the whole earth| strong="H776" \w* \w was of one| strong="H259" \w* \w language| strong="H8193" \w*, \w and of one| strong="H259" \w* \w speech| strong="H1697" \w*.\f + \fr 11:1 \ft language: Heb. lip. \f* \f + \fr 11:1 \ft speech: Heb. words \f* 
