\v 7 [Go to]{strong=“H3051” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”}, [let us go down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [and there confound]{strong=“H1101” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w their language| strong="H8193" \w*, \w that| strong="H834" \w* [they may not understand]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w one| strong="H376" \w* [another’s]{strong=“H7453”} \w speech| strong="H8193" \w*. 
\v 8 So the \sc Lord\sc* [scattered them abroad]{strong=“H6327” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w from thence| strong="H8033" \w* \w upon the face| strong="H6440" \w* \w of all the earth| strong="H776" \w*: [and they left off]{strong=“H2308” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [to build]{strong=“H1129” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} \w the city| strong="H5892" \w*. 
\v 9 \w Therefore is the name of it| strong="H8034" \w* [called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w Babel| strong="H894" \w*; because the \sc Lord\sc* [did there confound]{strong=“H1101” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w the language| strong="H8193" \w* \w of all the earth| strong="H776" \w*: \w and from thence did| strong="H6327" \w* the \sc Lord\sc* [scatter them abroad]{strong=“H6327” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w upon the face| strong="H6440" \w* \w of all the earth| strong="H776" \w*.\f + \fr 11:9 \ft Babel: that is, Confusion \f* 
\p
