\v 6 \w But Abram| strong="H87" \w* [said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto Sarai| strong="H8297" \w*, [Behold, thy maid]{strong=“H8198”} is \w in thy hand| strong="H3027" \w*; [do]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} [to her as it pleaseth thee]{strong=“H5869 H2896”}. \w And when Sarai| strong="H8297" \w* [dealt hardly with]{strong=“H6031” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} [her, she fled]{strong=“H1272” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w from her face| strong="H6440" \w*.\f + \fr 16:6 \ft as…: Heb. that which is good in thine eyes \f* \f + \fr 16:6 \ft dealt…: Heb. afflicted her \f* 
\p
