\v 28 [And they said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [We saw]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [certainly]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} that the \sc Lord\sc* [was with thee: and we said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w Let there be now an oath| strong="H423" \w* \w betwixt| strong="H996" \w* us, even \w betwixt| strong="H996" \w* [us and thee, and let us make]{strong=“H3772” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a covenant| strong="H1285" \w* with thee;\f + \fr 26:28 \ft We saw…: Heb. Seeing we saw \f* 
