\v 4 [And she gave]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w him Bilhah| strong="H1090" \w* \w her handmaid| strong="H8198" \w* \w to wife| strong="H802" \w*: \w and Jacob| strong="H3290" \w* [went in]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} unto her. 
