\v 28 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, [Appoint]{strong=“H5344” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8798”} \w me thy wages| strong="H7939" \w*, [and I will give]{strong=“H5414” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} it. 
\v 29 [And he said]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} [unto him, Thou knowest]{strong=“H3045” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} \w how| strong="H834" \w* [I have served]{strong=“H5647” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”} [thee, and how]{strong=“H834”} \w thy cattle| strong="H4735" \w* was with me. 
\v 30 For it was \w little| strong="H4592" \w* \w which thou hadst before I| strong="H6440" \w* came, and it is now [increased]{strong=“H6555” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w unto a multitude| strong="H7230" \w*; and the \sc Lord\sc* [hath blessed]{strong=“H1288” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8762”} \w thee since my coming| strong="H7272" \w*: \w and now when| strong="H4970" \w* [shall I provide]{strong=“H6213” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w for mine own house| strong="H1004" \w* also?\f + \fr 30:30 \ft increased: Heb. broken forth \f* \f + \fr 30:30 \ft since…: Heb. at my foot \f* 
