\v 2 These are \w the generations| strong="H8435" \w* \w of Jacob| strong="H3290" \w*. \w Joseph| strong="H3130" \w*, being [seventeen]{strong=“H7651 H6240”} \w years| strong="H8141" \w* \w old| strong="H1121" \w*, [was feeding]{strong=“H7462” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w the flock| strong="H6629" \w* \w with his brethren| strong="H251" \w*; \w and the lad| strong="H5288" \w* was \w with the sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Bilhah| strong="H1090" \w*, \w and with the sons| strong="H1121" \w* \w of Zilpah| strong="H2153" \w*, [his father’s]{strong=“H1”} \w wives| strong="H802" \w*: \w and Joseph| strong="H3130" \w* [brought]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”} \w unto his father| strong="H1" \w* \w their evil| strong="H7451" \w* \w report| strong="H1681" \w*. 
