\v 5 [And she yet again conceived]{strong=“H3254” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8686”}, [and bare]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w a son| strong="H1121" \w*; [and called]{strong=“H7121” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”} \w his name| strong="H8034" \w* \w Shelah| strong="H7956" \w*: \w and he was at Chezib| strong="H3580" \w*, [when she bare]{strong=“H3205” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”} him. 
