\c 41
\p 
\v 1 \w And it came to pass at the end| strong="H7093" \w* \w of two full| strong="H3117" \w* \w years| strong="H8141" \w*, \w that Pharaoh| strong="H6547" \w* [dreamed]{strong=“H2492” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”}: [and, behold, he stood]{strong=“H5975” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8802”} \w by the river| strong="H2975" \w*. 
