\v 11 [And there will I nourish]{strong=“H3557” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8773”} thee; for yet there are \w five| strong="H2568" \w* \w years| strong="H8141" \w* \w of famine| strong="H7458" \w*; [lest thou, and thy household]{strong=“H1004”}, [and all that thou hast, come to poverty]{strong=“H3423” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8735”}. 
