\v 13 [And ye shall tell]{strong=“H5046” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w my father| strong="H1" \w* \w of all my glory| strong="H3519" \w* \w in Egypt| strong="H4714" \w*, [and of all that ye have seen]{strong=“H7200” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}; [and ye shall haste]{strong=“H4116” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8765”} [and bring down]{strong=“H3381” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8689”} \w my father| strong="H1" \w* hither. 
