\p
\v 16 \w And the fame| strong="H6963" \w* [thereof was heard]{strong=“H8085” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8738”} [in Pharaoh’s]{strong=“H6547”} \w house| strong="H1004" \w*, [saying]{strong=“H559” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8800”}, [Joseph’s]{strong=“H3130”} \w brethren| strong="H251" \w* [are come]{strong=“H935” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8804”}: [and it pleased]{strong=“H5869 H3190”} \w Pharaoh| strong="H6547" \w* [well]{strong=“H5869 H3190” x-morph=“strongMorph: \sc Th\sc*8799”}, \w and| strong="H5869" \w* \w his servants| strong="H5650" \w*.\f + \fr 45:16 \ft pleased…: Heb. was good in the eyes of Pharaoh \f* 
